# Commit Message Template for Livox Mid-360 Docker Project
#
# Format: <type>: <subject>
#
# Types:
#   [FEAT]     New feature
#   [FIX]      Bug fix
#   [DOCS]     Documentation changes
#   [CONFIG]   Configuration changes (Dockerfile, docker-compose, configs)
#   [LAUNCH]   Launch file changes
#   [REFACTOR] Code refactoring
#   [TEST]     Test additions or changes
#   [CHORE]    Maintenance tasks
#
# Subject: Brief description (50 chars or less)
# Body: Detailed explanation (wrap at 72 chars)
# Footer: Reference issues, breaking changes, etc.
#
# Example:
# feat: add multi-lidar support to driver launch file
#
# - Added configuration for multiple Mid-360 units
# - Updated MID360_config.json with array support
# - Modified launch file to handle multi_topic parameter
#
# Closes #123

